			"notes": "### Added:\nCut Iron variants: Cut Iron Blocks, Cut Iron Stairs, and Cut Iron Slabs (available in all oxidation and waxed states).\nCreate mod integration: Full support for Industrial Iron Blocks, Industrial Iron Windows, and Industrial Iron Window Panes (rusting, waxing, scraping, and EMI support).\n\nAdded new languages: Spanish, German, Russian, Ukrainian, Czech, Slovak, Japanese, Hindi, Italian, French, Portuguese, Chinese.\nNew config option: enableCreateCompat to toggle Create mod integration.\n\n### Changed:\nRemoved Rustable Iron Block: Vanilla Iron Blocks now rust directly using standard copper oxidation mechanics.\n\nImproved particles: Added block breaking particles when scraping rust or unwaxing blocks with an axe (toggleable in config)."
